# ---------------------------------------------------------------- order
textOrder is operation
textOrder purpose "How two texts compare byte by byte, as Python orders `str` (UTF-8 keeps code-point order): -1, 0, or 1"
textOrder invariant ordersText "\"Gives -1 when the left text sorts first, 1 when the right does, 0 when they are the same\""
textOrder typeParameter none
textOrder input left machine.Address copied
